              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakubavusela umprofethi phakathi kwabafowabo onjengawe, ngibeke amazwi ami emlonyeni wakhe; futhi uyokhuluma kubo konke engimyala ngakho.",
          "type": "text",
