              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa umprofethi ozidlayo ukuba akhulume izwi egameni lami engingamyalanga ukuba alikhulume, noma oyakukhuluma egameni labanye onkulunkulu, lowo mprofethi naye uyakufa.",
