        {
          "text": "Lapho umprofethi ekhuluma egameni likaJehova, le nto ingalandeli futhi ingenzeki, yizwi uJehova angalikhulumanga, kodwa umprofethi walikhuluma ngokugabadela; ungamesabi.",
